{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0133","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000107:text","row":23869,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うーむ」","en":"“...Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"...mhhh-hm.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000012d:text","row":23870,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"夜は原稿書きだ。","en":"That night, I worked on the script.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00002","en":"The night is for writing this script.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000155:text","row":23871,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"いまいちはかどらない。","en":"I wasn’t getting anywhere.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00003","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00003","en":"It's progressing in ways unsatisfactory.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000183:text","row":23872,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"ありきたりな内容。","en":"What I had was painfully conventional.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00004","en":"Content is predictable.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000001ad:text","row":23873,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"けど、とりあえずは進めておかないと。","en":"Still, I had to keep at it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00005","en":"But, for the time being, I must simply advance it.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000001f1:text","row":23874,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「おもしろみに欠けるねぇ」","en":"“It just doesn’t have any spark.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00006","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00006","en":"Taichi: \"This thing's lacking on the fun, innit.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000223:text","row":23875,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"そうだ。","en":"I know.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00007","en":"Right!","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000243:text","row":23876,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩に見てもらうか。","en":"Maybe I should have Miyasumi take a look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00008","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00008","en":"Should I let Senpai look it over?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000026f:text","row":23877,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"思い立ったが吉日。","en":"No time like the present.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00009","en":"As the saying goes, the right moment to do things is the moment you think of them.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000299:text","row":23878,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐに家を出た。","en":"I left the house at once.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00010","en":"I left the house straight away.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000002c1:text","row":23879,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩の家だ。","en":"Soon, I was standing outside Miyasumi’s house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00011","en":"This is Senpai's house.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000003b6:text","row":23880,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ノックをしてみるが、反応がない。","en":"I knocked, but no one answered.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00012","en":"I try to knock, but there is no reply.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000003f6:text","row":23881,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「せんぱーい！」","en":"“Miyasumiii!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00013","en":"Taichi: \"SENPAAAI!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000041e:text","row":23882,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"やはりレスポンスがない。","en":"Again, no answer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00014","en":"As expected, no response.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000456:text","row":23883,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「あなたの太一が来ましたよー！」","en":"“Your Taichi is heeere!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00015","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Your Taichi has cooome!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000048e:text","row":23884,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"シーン","en":"Dead silence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00016","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00016","en":"Loud silence.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000004ac:text","row":23885,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"留守かな。","en":"Maybe she was out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00017","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00017","en":"She absent, maybe?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000004d6:text","row":23886,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00018","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00018","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000004fb:text","row":23887,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"まさか、まだ学校にいる？","en":"She wasn’t still at school... was she?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00019","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00019","en":"Are you kidding me, she's still as school?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000618:text","row":23888,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわー、いるし！」","en":"“Oh, come on—she is here!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00020","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Whoooa, she is!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000701:text","row":23889,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっ、ぺけくん？」","en":"“Oh! X?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00021","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00021","en":"Misato: \"Wah, Peke-kun?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000735:text","row":23890,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「無茶しすぎ！」","en":"“You’re pushing yourself way too hard!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00022","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00022","en":"Taichi: \"You're pushing yourself way too far!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000007e3:text","row":23891,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさい」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00023","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00023","en":"Misato: \"A-, apologies!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000817:text","row":23892,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「はー」","en":"“Haaah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Sigh...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000837:text","row":23893,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"例によってというか、アンテナを組み立てていたようだ。","en":"Sure enough, she was putting the antenna together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00025","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00025","en":"As is her habit, I should say, she seemed to be assembling the antenna.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000088b:text","row":23894,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな暗くて作業も何もないでしょーが」","en":"“It’s pitch-dark. You can’t get any work done like this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00026","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00026","en":"Taichi: \"There's no working at all in this pitch black darkness!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000008f0:text","row":23895,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「気になっちゃって……ダメですか？」","en":"“I couldn’t stop thinking about it... Is that so bad?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00027","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00027","en":"Misato: \"It worried me... is that bad?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000934:text","row":23896,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダメ」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00028","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00028","en":"Taichi: \"It's bad.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000095c:text","row":23897,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなことしてる暇があったら、原稿見てくださいよ」","en":"“If you’ve got time for that, read my script.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00029","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00029","en":"Taichi: \"If you have free time to do that, then please check the script.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000a2e:text","row":23898,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「おや、もうできましたか？」","en":"“Oh? You finished it already?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00030","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00030","en":"Misato: \"My, you managed it already?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000a6a:text","row":23899,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「途中です。でも意見聞きたくて」","en":"“Not yet. But I wanted your opinion.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00031","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00031","en":"Taichi: \"It is on the way. But I would still like to hear your opinion.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000b28:text","row":23900,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、でもこう暗いと……読めないですね」","en":"“Ah, but it’s so dark... I can’t read it.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00032","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00032","en":"Misato: \"Ahhh, but with this darkness... I cannot read this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000b72:text","row":23901,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「そですね」","en":"“Right.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00033","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00033","en":"Taichi: \"So you cannot.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000b9e:text","row":23902,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「もういいですから帰りましょう」","en":"“That’s enough. We’re going home.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00034","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Well, this is enough already, so let us head home.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000c5c:text","row":23903,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、でも……もうちょっと」","en":"“But... just a little longer.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00035","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00035","en":"Misato: \"Ah, but... I still want to...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000c98:text","row":23904,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「みみ先輩……」","en":"“Mimi...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00036","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Mimi-senpai...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000d46:text","row":23905,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「だってぇ～」","en":"“But I waaant to.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00037","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00037","en":"Misato: \"Buuu～t...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000d74:text","row":23906,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「焦って進めても、得るものはないんですよ」","en":"“You won’t gain anything by rushing it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00038","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00038","en":"Taichi: \"If you rush forwards you will not obtain what you want.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000e3c:text","row":23907,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00039","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00039","en":"Misato: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000e64:text","row":23908,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「ゆっくりやればいいんです。違いますか？」","en":"“Take your time. Am I wrong?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00040","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00040","en":"Taichi: \"You would do better to take things slow. Am I wrong?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000eae:text","row":23909,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「時間はたっぷりあるんですから」","en":"“We’ve got plenty of time.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00041","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Because we have sooo much time still.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000eee:text","row":23910,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに急げば……それだけはやく終わってしまう」","en":"“And the sooner you finish... the sooner it will all be over.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00042","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00042","en":"Taichi: \"If you hurry this... then this is the only thing that will end faster.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00000f3e:text","row":23911,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、それに耐えられるんですか？」","en":"“Can you bear that, Miyasumi?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00043","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai, would you even be able to stand that?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001005:text","row":23912,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っ」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00044","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00044","en":"Misato: \"...!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001027:text","row":23913,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"泣きそうな顔。","en":"She looked ready to cry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00045","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00045","en":"A tearful face.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000104d:text","row":23914,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"背筋が痺れた。","en":"A chill ran down my spine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00046","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00046","en":"My spinal column goes numb.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001073:text","row":23915,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"つい、自分が禁忌を口走っていたことに気づく。","en":"I realized I’d blurted out the one thing I wasn’t supposed to say.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00047","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00047","en":"And I realize that, accidentally, I let my mouth run to the taboo.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000010dc:text","row":23916,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わたし、逃げてるんでしょうか」","en":"“Am I... running away?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00048","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00048","en":"Misato: \"...I... I am running away, then?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001120:text","row":23917,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「そですね」","en":"“I’d say so.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00049","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00049","en":"Taichi: \"You are.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001169:text","row":23918,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう、見えちゃいますか？」","en":"“Is that how it looks?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00050","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00050","en":"Misato: \"Is it... that noticeable?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000011a5:text","row":23919,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「見えちゃいます」","en":"“I’m afraid it does.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00051","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00051","en":"Taichi: \"It is that noticeable.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000011d7:text","row":23920,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「作業に没頭することで、逃げてる」","en":"“You’re burying yourself in the work so you don’t have to face it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00052","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00052","en":"Taichi: \"You are running away by sinking into work.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001211:text","row":23921,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナを見あげる。","en":"I looked up at the antenna.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00053","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00053","en":"I look up at the antenna.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001245:text","row":23922,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「無理矢理、仕事を作るようにして……わざと手間がかかるやり方で」","en":"“You invent work for yourself... then go out of your way to do it the hard way.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00054","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00054","en":"Taichi: \"By hook or by crook, you find work to do... and in the most time-consuming way, intentionally.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001323:text","row":23923,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「……見抜かれてましたか」","en":"“...You saw right through me.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00055","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00055","en":"Misato: \"...did you see through me?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000135d:text","row":23924,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「それが普通だと思ったんです」","en":"“I thought it was only natural.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00056","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00056","en":"Taichi: \"I thought it was normal.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001419:text","row":23925,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00057","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00057","en":"Misato: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001453:text","row":23926,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩のしていることは、そうおかしなことじゃない」","en":"“What you’re doing isn’t so strange.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00058","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00058","en":"Taichi: \"If Senpai was doing it, it couldn't be that strange.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000014a5:text","row":23927,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「逃避をしたことのない人間なんていませんよ」","en":"“Everyone runs away sometimes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00059","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00059","en":"Taichi: \"There is no such thing as a human who has never run away!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000014f1:text","row":23928,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「けど先輩みたいに、必死に逃避しなければならないのは……つらいことだ」","en":"“But having to run from things as desperately as you do... that has to hurt.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00060","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00060","en":"Taichi: \"But to be like you, Senpai, being unable to do anything but run away as if your life depended on it... that is heart-breaking.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001557:text","row":23929,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「もちません、心は」","en":"“Your heart can only take so much.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00061","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00061","en":"Taichi: \"It can't last, that heart of yours.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001609:text","row":23930,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00062","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00062","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001635:text","row":23931,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「あなたは……３０を越えているはずだ」","en":"“You must be... above thirty.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00063","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00063","en":"Taichi: \"You... must've gone above 30 by now.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001698:text","row":23932,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00064","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00064","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000016c4:text","row":23933,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「強度の自傷症状」","en":"“Severe symptoms of self-harm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00065","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00065","en":"Taichi: \"Symptoms: intense self-injury.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001713:text","row":23934,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00066","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00066","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001737:text","row":23935,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"無言という肯定。","en":"Her silence said yes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00067","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00067","en":"A silence called assent.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000175f:text","row":23936,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はただ、言葉を重ねる。","en":"All I could do was keep talking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00068","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00068","en":"I merely kept piling word on word.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001797:text","row":23937,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「一人で作業するのはいい。けど追いつめられているなら……このまま単独で没頭するのは危険だ」","en":"“Working alone is fine. But if you’re already cornered... losing yourself in the work all by yourself is dangerous.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00069","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00069","en":"Taichi: \"Hard labor on your own is fine. But letting yourself be cornered by it... you keep sinking into this on your own, that's dangerous.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001811:text","row":23938,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「……弾けたとき、ここが屋上だってことが、危険だ」","en":"“...And if you snap, a rooftop is a dangerous place to be.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00070","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00070","en":"Taichi: \"...when that explodes, you being here on this rooftop is dangerous.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001863:text","row":23939,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかってますか？」","en":"“Do you understand?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00071","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00071","en":"Taichi: \"Do you understand this?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000018b4:text","row":23940,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかって、ますよ」","en":"“I... understand.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00072","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00072","en":"Misato: \"I under... stand.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000018e0:text","row":23941,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"ぽつ、と言う。","en":"She said it quietly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00073","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00073","en":"Fragmentary, to say.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000190e:text","row":23942,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「たいへん心配です」","en":"“I’m seriously worried about you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00074","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00074","en":"Taichi: \"This is a really big worry for me.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000193a:text","row":23943,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は眼鏡を外した。","en":"Miyasumi took off her glasses.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00075","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00075","en":"Senpai took off her glasses.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001966:text","row":23944,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"涙ぐんだ瞳に、指の背を添える。","en":"She dabbed at her tearful eyes with the back of one finger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00076","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00076","en":"The back of her fingers accompany themselves to her tear-filled eyes.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001a22:text","row":23945,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんに、心配されるくらい……不安定だったんですね、わたし」","en":"“I must have been a mess... if even you were worried about me, X.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00077","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00077","en":"Misato: \"I make even you worry, Peke-kun... I am so unstable, that is why.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001a82:text","row":23946,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「はは……その言い方は、失礼だなあ」","en":"“Hah... That’s a pretty rude way to put it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00078","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00078","en":"Taichi: \"Hahah... saying it that way's a bit impolite!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001ae3:text","row":23947,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「あはは」","en":"“Ahaha.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00079","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00079","en":"Misato: \"Ahahah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001b2a:text","row":23948,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「君にこんなこと言われるなんてびっくりしました」","en":"“I never thought I’d hear that from you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00080","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00080","en":"Misato: \"But I am surprised at you telling me this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001b72:text","row":23949,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"涙をぬぐう。","en":"She wiped away her tears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00081","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00081","en":"She wipes her tears.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001c1c:text","row":23950,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ありがとう」","en":"“...Thank you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00082","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00082","en":"Misato: \"...thank you.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001c4e:text","row":23951,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいえ」","en":"“You’re welcome.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00083","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00083","en":"Taichi: \"'s nothing.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001c95:text","row":23952,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって……みんなバラバラで……このまま霧散するみたいで」","en":"“It’s just... everyone’s scattered... and it feels like we’re going to dissolve.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00084","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00084","en":"Misato: \"But... we are broken up and scattered around here and there... soon, it will be as if we had all vanished into the fog.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001cef:text","row":23953,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺は霧散してないですよ」","en":"“I haven’t dissolved.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00085","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00085","en":"Taichi: \"I will not vanish into the fog!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001da7:text","row":23954,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、君はなんだか……動機が不純」","en":"“But you... I’m not sure your motives are entirely pure.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00086","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00086","en":"Misato: \"But you have... less than pure motives, so to say.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001de5:text","row":23955,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"ばれてた。","en":"Busted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00087","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00087","en":"Exposed.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001e0f:text","row":23956,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Well.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00088","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00088","en":"Taichi: \"Well.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001eb5:text","row":23957,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも確かにわたし、意固地になっていたのかも」","en":"“Still, maybe I was just being stubborn.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00089","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00089","en":"Misato: \"But it is true that I have become obstinate, perhaps.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001f03:text","row":23958,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに厳密には一人じゃないみたいですよ？」","en":"“And strictly speaking, it seems you weren’t alone.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00090","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00090","en":"Taichi: \"Besides, strictly speaking it seems you were not alone, you know?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001fcd:text","row":23959,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00091","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00091","en":"Misato: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00001ff5:text","row":23960,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「これ」","en":"“This.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00092","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00092","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00002015:text","row":23961,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"先ほど、給水塔の下でひろった包みを見せる。","en":"I showed her the package I’d found beneath the water tower earlier.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00093","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00093","en":"I show her the parcel that I found earlier at the foot of the water tower.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000020dd:text","row":23962,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「差し入れ？」","en":"“A care package?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00094","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00094","en":"Misato: \"A supply drop?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000210b:text","row":23963,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"「イエス」","en":"“Yep.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00095","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00095","en":"Taichi: \"Yess'uh.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00002135:text","row":23964,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「ただし中身はカレーパン」","en":"“Though all it has inside is curry bread.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00096","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00096","en":"Taichi: \"However, contents are curry bread.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000021ed:text","row":23965,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………あ」","en":"“............Oh.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00097","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00097","en":"Misato: \"......ah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:00002213:text","row":23966,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"気づいて、口元を押さえる。","en":"It dawned on her, and she covered her mouth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00098","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00098","en":"Realizing, she pins down her mouth.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000224d:text","row":23967,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「あいつも最近、ちょっとナーバスみたいでなかなか顔見せないですけど、ね」","en":"“He’s been on edge lately and hasn’t shown his face much, but...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00099","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00099","en":"Taichi: \"Lately, that guy seemed nervous enough that he would just not show face either, right.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000022b5:text","row":23968,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのバカ、自分の仲間が追い込まれるの、見てられない性格してますから」","en":"“That idiot can’t stand watching one of his own get backed into a corner.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00100","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00100","en":"Taichi: \"That idiot, he has the kind of personality that just cannot stand even looking at close friends being driven into a corner.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000231b:text","row":23969,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな傷みかけのカレーパン持ってきて」","en":"“And he brings you curry bread that’s already starting to go bad.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00101","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00101","en":"Taichi: \"And he brought you some near-spoiling curry bread.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000023e1:text","row":23970,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「でもぺけくん、嬉しそう」","en":"“But you look happy, X.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00102","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00102","en":"Misato: \"But you seem happy, Peke-kun.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:0000241b:text","row":23971,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「食べます？」","en":"“Want some?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00103","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00103","en":"Taichi: \"Shall we eat?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000024a2:text","row":23972,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は小さくうなずいた。","en":"Miyasumi gave a small nod.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00104","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00104","en":"Senpai made a tiny nods.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0133:000024d2:text","row":23973,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"二人で、カレーパンを食べた。","en":"We ate the curry bread together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00105","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00105","en":"We ate curry bread, the two of us.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]}]}
